<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">BLAZER: <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">B</span>ootstrapping <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">L</span>LM-based Manipulation <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">A</span>gents 
<br class="ltx_break">with <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Zer</span>o-Shot Data Generation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Rocktim Jyoti Das
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Harsh Singh
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Diana Turmakhan
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
