<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 3</span>: </span><span id="S3.F3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Tasks in simulation.<span id="S3.F3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We consider 9 pick-and-place tasks from RLBench simulator <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">45</a>]</cite>. For each task we display a starting condition (top) and the desired final state (bottom).</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
